mongfontbuilder
================================================================================

The shaping rules in `src/rules.rs` are ported from mongfontbuilder's OpenType
shaping pipeline, and the data they run on (`python/mongol_norm/data/*.json`,
compiled into `src/generated/`) is generated from mongfontbuilder.
