The `font` feature bundles the Hudum font mongfontbuilder composes
(`fonts/hudum.otf`, outlines removed; `fonts/mongfontbuilder.json` pins the
commit), with its OpenType Layout rules under the same MIT License.

================================================================================
Noto Sans Mongolian (the bundled shaping font's source)
================================================================================

`fonts/hudum.otf` is composed from mongfontbuilder's test source
`tests/fonts/hudum.ufo`, whose drawings derive from Noto Sans Mongolian. The
bundled font carries none of the drawings — only the layout tables — and keeps
the source's licence:

    Copyright 2023 The Noto Project Authors
    (https://github.com/notofonts/mongolian)

    This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
    Version 1.1. This license is available with a FAQ at:
    https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

    Noto is a trademark of Google Inc.

The licence text is in `fonts/OFL.txt`; `fonts/NOTICE.txt` describes the font.

================================================================================
UTN #57 / Unicode
================================================================================

The shaping rules also implement the algorithm described in Unicode Technical
Note #57 (v4), "Encoding and Shaping of the Mongolian Script". Unicode data and
technical materials are subject to the Unicode Terms of Use / Unicode License.

Source: https://www.unicode.org/notes/tn57/tn57-4.html
